{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S01、S05 这类短停留段感受信息过密，纵向交替阅读不如 X 一眼好扫；个别叙述还对人物原意作了额外推断。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用重点加亮把每段的情绪转折和叙事要点凸显出来，感受描述也更贴近音乐的音色、节奏、力度和细微身体反应，水波、小船等意象贯穿前后，整体连贯性更强。X 的完整句子更容易理解人物为什么犹豫、害怕和改变，而且对原意的保留更稳；Y 有些地方把原本的心理推断改成了新的结论，例如把想得到保证但明知不可能，改成即使听到保证仍然害怕。综合来看，Y 的表达层次和感受细腻度更有优势，但 X 的阅读效率和心理动机准确度更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "35bc0061-975a-41e1-abe0-05bc39505b87", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T182501501399Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.063, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:26:19.574604+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "07913d26fc5b02b486c70bcc877ad6509246527a3fa05c15c6b2ed82f52f410b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa